### Wayle Configuration - Dock Settings

## Dock Configuration - General Settings

settings-dock-position = Position
    .description = Dock position on screen (bottom, left, or right)

settings-dock-visibility = Visibility
    .description = Whether the dock is always visible or autohides

settings-dock-autohide-delay = Autohide Delay
    .description = Time in milliseconds before the dock autohides

settings-dock-size = Size
    .description = Dock item size in pixels

## Dock Configuration - Appearance Settings

settings-dock-item-padding = Item Padding
    .description = Space between dock items

settings-dock-item-rounding = Item Rounding
    .description = Corner rounding for dock items

settings-dock-background-opacity = Background Opacity
    .description = Dock background transparency (0-100%)

settings-dock-bg = Background Color
    .description = Dock background color

## Dock Configuration - Item Settings

settings-dock-show-running = Show Running Apps
    .description = Show running applications alongside pinned items

settings-dock-show-preview = Show Preview
    .description = Enable window preview on hover

settings-dock-pinned-apps = Pinned Applications
    .description = List of application IDs shown in the dock

## DockPosition enum variants
enum-dock-position-bottom = Bottom
enum-dock-position-left = Left
enum-dock-position-right = Right

## DockVisibility enum variants
enum-dock-visibility-always-visible = Always Visible
enum-dock-visibility-autohide = Autohide